 "definitions": {
  "deviation": "|FE - continuum| / |continuum| against the Rayleigh continuum (the product's continuum limit), maximum over the cantilever, propped cantilever, pinned-pinned and fixed-fixed spans, both lengths unless split, both spectra and every quantity of the kind",
  "kinds": {"displacement": "tip or midspan displacement", "force": "internal shear at L/4 and L/2", "moment": "internal bending moment at L/4 and L/2", "reaction": "end reaction forces and moments"},
  "categories": {"frequency": "first five (or all finite) modes", "per_mode": "signed modal contributions whose continuum value exceeds 1e-30 times the largest absolute continuum contribution of that quantity over the five continuum modes (the rest, zero by symmetry or rounding residue, are excluded); dominated by small contributions near a zero of the quantity's modal distribution", "per_mode_significant": "the same, restricted to contributions at least 1 % of the quantity's continuum SRSS over nm = min(5, the FE model's finite mode count) continuum modes (not always five)", "combined": "SRSS, CQC and grouping over the first five (or all finite) modes, against the continuum combined over the same number of modes", "missing_mass_total": "periodic part (SRSS or CQC) with the rigid part (SRSS or absolute sum), truncation after 1, 2, 3 and 5 modes (includes cases where the FE mesh classifies a different number of modes as periodic, because an FE frequency lies on the other side of f_r = 1.01 f_n)", "missing_mass_total_same_classification": "the same, restricted to cases with the continuum's periodic count"},
  "lengths": {"L2": "rotary inertia changes the first three frequencies by MORE than 1e-6 relative (it matters)", "L64": "rotary inertia changes the first three frequencies by LESS than 1e-6 relative (negligible)"},
  "lumped": "NOT the product's formulation; measures the size of that modelling difference",
  "for_the_screening_derivation": {"sensitivity": "largest_sensitivity is a conditional SRSS sensitivity: one mode's frequency varies alone, with its shape, its participation and its force-recovery coefficient q_n held fixed; it excludes changes of the CQC coefficient, of the rigid response, of the shape and recovery, and rotations", "coarse_mesh_classification": "on a coarse mesh the same rigid frequency f_r can classify a different number of modes as periodic; missing_mass_total includes such cases, missing_mass_total_same_classification excludes them", "left_out_of_the_maxima": "the quarter-point quantities (M_quarter_Nm, V_quarter_N) at N = 2, where L/4 is not a node; and quantities whose continuum value is zero by symmetry (per-mode values of zero-participation modes; V_mid_N and the moment reaction at a pin, which are not published for the symmetric spans and the pinned end)", "L64_negligible_applies_to_modes_1_to_3": "at L = 64 m rotary inertia shifts modes 4 and 5 by 6.6e-7 to 1.23e-6 (mode 5 above 1e-6 in every span); the five-mode categories include them"}
 },
